-c:a copy palm_final.mp4
Why the ghosts appeared:
Font Substitution: Without fontfile=, FFmpeg looks for a "system default." On some Arch builds, the default is a bitmap font that doesn't scale well, causing FFmpeg to render a "preview" size and a "scaled" size simultaneously.

YUV Chroma Subsampling: Since your video is yuv420p, the text filter sometimes struggles with "box" borders if they aren't on even-numbered pixel coordinates. I shifted the y coordinates to -120 and -60 (multiples of 2) to ensure the hardware encoder doesn't get confused.

